// Round 5 — migration 003: the client definitions of 17 Aug 2026.
//
// FOR AN ENVIRONMENT WHERE 001 + 002 ARE ALREADY INSTALLED (the Round-1b
// state, 31 vertices / 44 edges) and may already hold loaded data. Additive
// only — no vertex changes shape, nothing is removed, no existing attribute
// changes meaning, and NOTHING here touches data: no DROP, no DELETE, no
// UPDATE, no loading statement of any kind.
//
// A fresh environment skips this file and installs 01_vertices.gsql →
// 02_edges.gsql → 03_create_graph.gsql instead. All install paths MUST
// converge on the identical schema — scripts/verify_schema_parity.py asserts
// it (baseline_f2/ + 001 + 002 + 003 == clean install).
USE GLOBAL

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// One global schema-change job, three vertices (the spec's earlier statement
// that only the advisor vertex changes was wrong — Round 5 task 3 supersedes
// it):
//   - revenue_transaction + monthly_revenue: the client uses TWO reason-code
//     filters — firm/dashboard (NOT IN 9X,XX) and advisor (NOT IN
//     9X,XX,9R,98,99,9H) — and credited_amt is precomputed at build time, so
//     TWO precomputed columns must exist. firm_credited_amt passes the FIRM
//     filter (else 0); advisor_credited_amt passes the ADVISOR filter
//     (else 0). The existing credited_amt is KEPT and equals
//     advisor_credited_amt (every query/rule/finding references it —
//     app/shared/reason_codes.py holds both filters, DECISIONS.md records
//     the choice).
//   - advisor: the six client-requirement attributes (job_display_name from
//     the client's authoritative mapping — NOT in any source table;
//     em_status_cd A|L|T; is_departed = status 'T'; work_state/work_city from
//     fpic_employee_tb; advisor_plan PRIVATE_CLIENT|SELECT_ADVISOR from the
//     job-code family) PLUS is_synthetic — task 3's own requirement: the
//     4,125,052 NULL-advisor transactions count firm-wide and load under the
//     synthetic advisor '__UNATTRIBUTED__' (is_synthetic=true, name blank —
//     never invented; excluded from rankings/peer/exceptions/dropdown).
// Existing rows keep working — new attributes default empty/0/false.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CREATE GLOBAL SCHEMA_CHANGE JOB migration_003_client_definitions {
  ALTER VERTEX phx_dm_pce_revenue_transaction ADD ATTRIBUTE (
    firm_credited_amt DOUBLE,
    advisor_credited_amt DOUBLE
  );
  ALTER VERTEX phx_dm_pce_monthly_revenue ADD ATTRIBUTE (
    firm_credited_amt DOUBLE,
    advisor_credited_amt DOUBLE
  );
}
RUN GLOBAL SCHEMA_CHANGE JOB migration_003_client_definitions
